claim.claim-text:
1. Apparatus for medical manipulation of a patient's penis for examination and treatment of a urethral stricture, the apparatus comprising:
penile clamp means, comprising support members for the patient's penis and a slider block, a revolving slide support and base support means for supporting the revolving slide support;
the support members comprising proximal penile clamp means for clamping the patient's penis at a proximal location and distal penile injection support means supporting the patient's penis distally from said proximal location, the support members configured to provide support for insertion of a catheter tip syringe for placement unto the patient's fossa navicularis urethrae;
the slider block having a configuration to allow the penile clamp assembly to slide along a length of the revolving slide support; and
the revolving slide support providing radiological measurement indicia; and
means for pivoting at the base support means.
